  "description": "XSLT 3.0, XSLT 2.0 and XPath 3.1 processor for .NET, compiled to IL. Built on the engine behind System.Xml.Xsl.XslCompiledTransform and keeps its API, so XSLT 1.0 stylesheets run unchanged with identical output. Adds maps, arrays and higher-order functions, xsl:try, xsl:iterate, xsl:merge, accumulators, packages, JSON functions and json/adaptive/HTML5 output. Alpha: xsl:evaluate, schema awareness and streaming aren't supported yet.",
